<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>club</i>, freq. shod with iron
			for fighting, <i>mace</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδηρείῃ κορύνῃ ῥήγνυσκε φάλαγγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.141
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				143
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλων κορύνας ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύναις τύπτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1311b28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shepherd's staff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in plants,
				<i>knobby bud</i> or <i>shoot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.5.1
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσθη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				409
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.128
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Autom.
			</span></i>). [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.19
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				715
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.63
			</span></i>, Nic.l.c.]</div>
